msgid "默认实现统一为 **Core / Arch / SoC / Board / 静态 factory / 多态 I/O / 可选 OS / 可选组件**。一份 TOML 经严格校验和不可变 IR 生成精确实例；factory 返回稳定的 只读接口对象，共享只读操作表，独立状态留在 provider 内部。获取接口不启动硬件。 应用、产品任务、私有 PCB、Flash 分区、恢复与安全策略由外部工程维护。"
msgstr "The default implementation is **Core / Arch / SoC / Board / static factory / polymorphic I/O / optional OS / optional components**. One TOML is strictly validated and resolved through immutable IR to generate exact instances. The factory returns stable read-only interface objects with shared read-only operation tables; independent state remains inside each provider. Getting an interface does not start hardware. External projects own applications, product tasks, private PCBs, Flash partitions, recovery and security policy."

msgid "文档系统的后续整理见 [架构与交付规划](../design/documentation-system.md)。 对应文档工具、正文和图册已实现，实际文档验收与固件资格分别记录；当前资料总入口为 [文档入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/docs/README.md)。"
msgstr "Further documentation organization is described in [architecture and delivery planning](../design/documentation-system.md). The documentation tools, prose and figure atlas are implemented; documentation acceptance and firmware qualification are recorded separately. The current entry point is [documentation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/docs/README.md)."

