msgid "CPU 软件层覆盖 M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85。外部工程可通过一份 严格 CPU runtime TOML/事实包使用 `nexus_add_runtime` 或安装包的 Runtime component，复用 Core/Arch/I/O face 与选定裸机/FreeRTOS adapter。运行时装配 不生成 SoC、Board、启动或 factory，具体硬件、产品任务和安全策略仍由外部工程 负责。F407/F470 三板维护首发模式；F103/GD303 增加精确 legacy channel-DMA UART、I2C IRQ、Flash／ADC／PWM 等有限选择；G474 增加 bulb ADC 的单次／有限 TIM6-DMA、I2C 和 ECC Flash。H743 的固定 Cache 与有限 UART DMA 保留独立合同， 另有显式 D2 SRAM1 初始化及 SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/IWDG/Flash 软件夹具；U575 TZEN0 增加六类有限外设，独立 TZEN1 参考只维护同步 GPIO 与最多八项复制命令的 cooperative job。静态 factory 按模式保留精确状态和资源，不生成产品任务。 这些源实现不代表全系列、全外设或完整安全域资格，物理 HIL 全部未执行。"
msgstr "The CPU software layer covers M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85. External projects use one strict CPU runtime TOML/fact package through `nexus_add_runtime` or the installed Runtime component, reusing Core/Arch/I/O faces and the selected baremetal/FreeRTOS adapter. Runtime assembly does not generate SoC, Board, startup or factory; external projects still own specific hardware, product tasks and security policy. The three F407/F470 Boards maintain first-release modes. F103/GD303 add exact finite legacy channel-DMA UART, IRQ I2C and Flash/ADC/PWM selections. G474 adds bulb ADC shots/finite TIM6 DMA, I2C and ECC Flash. H743 retains separate fixed Cache and finite UART DMA contracts, with explicit D2 SRAM1 initialization and SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/IWDG/Flash software fixtures. U575 TZEN0 adds six finite peripheral classes; the independent TZEN1 reference maintains only synchronous GPIO and cooperative jobs of up to eight copied commands. Static factories retain exact mode state and resources without generating product tasks. These source implementations do not qualify whole families, all peripherals or complete security domains; physical HIL remains unexecuted."

msgid "本轮工业外设迭代的当前合同以 [精确支持](support.md)、各 SoC README 和 [主流 MCU 接入](../design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md) 为准。源码实现、定向开发 结果与最终冻结源码的软件资格分别记录；下列已绑定版本的历史结果不覆盖新代码， 也不为本轮补写未执行的测试计数、SDK、离线复现或候选状态。"
msgstr "The current contracts for this industrial-peripheral iteration are [exact support](support.md), the adjacent SoC README files and [mainstream MCU adaptation](../design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md). Source implementation, targeted developer results and final frozen-source software qualification are recorded separately. The version-bound historical results below do not cover new code or supply unexecuted test counts, SDK, offline reproduction or candidate status for this iteration."

msgid "历史 SoC 扩展基线固定源码 `98270512` 已完成全部 Native 契约、工具和配置测试、121 个 ARM 镜像、104 个 CPU runtime 变体、SDK 独立消费及完整 GitHub CI。八个 H743/U575 公开参考配置分别完成两次独立断网构建，ELF/BIN 逐字节一致，并封存为无签名软件 候选；具体范围和原始证据见结果索引。后续文档提交只记录该源码，不继承为新的 代码执行资格。实板未接入，物理 HIL 均为 `not_executed`。当前有限 F407 屏蔽 Flash 尾跳不代表通用运行态接管；SOC-34 的 DVFS 仍未实现。SOC-35 已增加 [U575 保留时钟与 Stop2](../design/u575-retained-time.md)的有界软件子集，使用独立 RTC 时间域与显式 WUT/Stop2 owner；另有同一 owner 的选定 [SRAM4/LPDMA 有限复制](../design/u575-stop2-copy.md)。通用外设 LPBAM 尚未实现， 物理复制、保留、精度、功耗及唤醒验收仍未执行。SOC-35 完整退出仍开放；全部 55 项原始退出条件保持不变。"
msgstr "The historical SoC-extension baseline at fixed source `98270512` completed all Native contracts, tool and configuration tests, 121 ARM images, 104 CPU-runtime variants, independent SDK consumption and full GitHub CI. Eight public H743/U575 reference configurations each completed two independent network-disabled builds with byte-identical ELF/BIN and were sealed as unsigned software candidates. Exact scope and raw evidence are in the results index. Later documentation commits only record that source and inherit no new code-execution qualification. Hardware is not connected; all physical HIL is `not_executed`. The current bounded F407 masked Flash tail transfer does not provide generic running-state adoption. SOC-34 DVFS remains unimplemented. SOC-35 now has a bounded software subset for [U575 retained time and Stop2](../design/u575-retained-time.md), using an independent RTC time domain and an explicit WUT/Stop2 owner. A separately selected [finite SRAM4/LPDMA copy](../design/u575-stop2-copy.md) uses the same owner. General peripheral LPBAM remains unimplemented; physical copy, retention, accuracy, power and wake acceptance remain unexecuted. The complete SOC-35 exit remains open; all 55 original exit conditions remain unchanged."

msgid "既有构建系统交付绑定 `cc6a065c`，完整结果单独记录在构建结果索引，不能继承 上面的历史 SoC 执行身份。该版本的八个候选使用 H743 HSI64／Cache off 和 U575 MSIS4／TZEN=0 的 empty／UART、裸机／FreeRTOS 参考组合；这不扩大实板支持。 72 阶段软件总计划未作为一次完整 plan invocation 执行，OCI recipe 重建、 CP311 离线安装和物理 HIL 仍未执行。后续文档提交只记录其精确代码源码。"
msgstr "The existing build-system delivery binds `cc6a065c`; its complete results are recorded separately in the build-results index and cannot inherit the historical SoC execution identity above. That version's eight candidates select H743 HSI64/Cache off and U575 MSIS4/TZEN=0 empty/UART, baremetal/FreeRTOS references; they do not expand physical support. The 72-stage software plan was not executed as one complete plan invocation. OCI recipe rebuilding, CP311 offline installation and physical HIL remain unexecuted. Later documentation commits only describe that exact code source."

msgid "`docs/archive/` 保留历史设计、结果和旧 Sphinx 教程，不能继承为当前支持或验收。 当前公共 API 文档只从现有公开 include 树生成；代码格式和反斜杠 Doxygen 风格保持 根 `.clang-format`、`.editorconfig` 与现有规范。"
msgstr "`docs/archive/` retains historical designs, results and old Sphinx tutorials; these confer no current support or acceptance. Current public API documentation is generated only from existing public include trees. Code formatting and backslash Doxygen style retain the root `.clang-format`, `.editorconfig` and existing standards."

msgid "行为变更遵循 TDD。GoogleTest／GoogleMock 只进入 host 测试目标，生产固件保持 C11。commit hooks 实际执行完整 testing／configure／ci／workflows 四域工具测试 和全部 GoogleTest 契约，拒绝未完成、过滤或跳过的报告。执行结果证明当前合同；真实 RED→GREEN 过程由 PR 和原始日志记录。"
msgstr "Behavior changes follow TDD. GoogleTest/GoogleMock enter host test targets only; production firmware remains C11. Commit hooks actually run the complete testing/configure/ci/workflows tool suites and all GoogleTest contracts, rejecting incomplete, filtered or skipped reports. Execution results prove current contracts; actual RED→GREEN history is recorded in PRs and raw logs."

msgid "[SoC refinement and physical acceptance](../design/soc-refinement.md)"
msgstr "[SoC refinement and physical acceptance](../design/soc-refinement.md)"

msgid "另有独立选定的 [LPTIM1 单组 LPBAM 软件参考](../design/u575-lptim1-lpbam.md)， 由同一 concrete Stop2 owner 管理固定 SRAM4 CCR1/RCR=0/ARR 更新及显式 start/stop 的部分失败恢复。它不建立引脚路线、完整波形播放或实板资格；物理 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`，原 IO-32/SOC-35 退出条件不变。完整 SDK 消费计划由 [维护的 transport policy](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/release/transport.py) 定义；历史 v7/v8 执行记录 不能覆盖新增选择。本页不宣称新增选择已取得完整 SDK、离线复现或软件候选资格。"
msgstr "A separately selected [LPTIM1 single-tuple LPBAM software reference](../design/u575-lptim1-lpbam.md) uses the same concrete Stop2 owner for fixed SRAM4 CCR1/RCR=0/ARR updates and partial-failure recovery of explicit start/stop. It establishes no pin route, complete waveform playback or board qualification; physical HIL remains `not_executed` and the original IO-32/SOC-35 exit criteria stay unchanged. The complete SDK consumer plan is defined by the [maintained transport policy](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/release/transport.py); historical v7/v8 execution records cannot cover new selections. This page does not claim complete SDK, offline reproduction or software-candidate qualification for additions."
